## Interface: 20504
## Title: Tankadin Gear Sim
## Notes: Live tank readout (uncrittable/uncrushable/EHP) + gear export for Lollerskate's Tankadin Gear Sim
## Author: NPC6388
## Version: 0.8.30
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Shield_06
## SavedVariables: TankadinGearSimDB, TankadinGearSimUI
## X-Category: Combat
